        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure safe loading and unloading for homes in Hazaribagh?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our trained crew follows a strict 7‑layer protective protocol, using high‑density bubble wrap, corrugated sheets, and calibrated hydraulic lifts. Each item is tagged, secured with ratchet lashings, and loaded onto specialized 18‑32 ft container trucks equipped with GPS tracking, guaranteeing zero‑damage handling from start to finish.</p>
