        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the insurance coverage calculated for household goods during the move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We offer 100 % declared‑value insurance approved by IRDAI. The premium is based on the total declared value of the consignment, the distance (Hazaribagh‑to‑Mumbai ~1499 km), and the nature of items. A detailed insurance quote is included in the instant estimate, ensuring full financial protection.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment live while it travels from Hazaribagh to Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every container truck is fitted with satellite‑enabled GPS devices. Once the load is dispatched, you receive a secure link to a live tracking dashboard that shows real‑time location, estimated arrival, and checkpoint status, giving you complete visibility throughout the journey.</p>
