      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors influence the loading/unloading tariff on this route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Tariffs are shaped by distance, truck size (18 ft, 22 ft, or 32 ft MX), weight of goods, number of staircases or elevators, and any special handling like fragile or antique items. GST rate on packers and movers and any additional insurance or expedited services also affect the final cost.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there special provisions for moving fragile or antique items?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Fragile items receive custom wooden crates, high‑density foam edge protectors, and double‑layer bubble wrap. Antique or temple pieces are secured with anti‑vibration mounts and placed on dedicated pallets. Our crew follows a separate handling checklist to ensure these valuables arrive intact.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does IBA approval benefit customers hiring Packers And Movers In Hazaribagh/loading Unloading?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">IBA (Indian Banks Association) approval means our operations meet stringent financial and operational standards, ensuring transparent billing, reliable claim settlement, and trustworthiness for corporate or government reimbursements. Clients enjoy smoother audit processes and confidence that their relocation partner adheres to industry‑wide best practices.</p>
